>     device   = 'KZPSA SCSI to SCSI Adapter'
>     class    = mass storage
>     subclass = SCSI
> 
> can i use this controllers width FreeBSD-Alpha?

No, there is no driver for the KZPSA. KZPSA is a DEC designed
FastWideDifferential SCSI (Highvoltage differential btw), with a proprietary
programming interface.

